Open Eclipse IDE.
Select File → New → Maven Project.
Select "Use Default Workspace Location" and click Next.

In Filter, type "apache" and select:

maven-archetype-quickstart

Enter the following details:

Group Id : com.program2.maven
Artifact Id : program2-example-jar
Version : 0.0.1-SNAPSHOT
Package : com.program2.maven.program2

Click Finish.
Confirm configuration by typing Y.
Right-click the project and select Maven Build.

Enter Goal:

package

Click Run.
Open App.java and run the Java application.

PROGRAM:

package com.program2.maven.program2;

public class App {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Hello World!");
    }
} 

plugins {
    id 'java'
    id 'application'
}

repositories {
    mavenCentral()
}

dependencies {
    testImplementation 'junit:junit:4.13.2'
}

application {
    mainClass.set('App')
}
